<title>USA: TABLE - F.N.B. Q2 share rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - F.N.B. Q2 share rises.</headline>
<dateline>HERMITAGE, Pa. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.55		    $0.42</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.54		     0.41</p>
<p> Net		 8,084		    6,157</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.02		    $0.84</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.99		     0.82</p>
<p> Net		 14,872		    12,233</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Previous periods restated to reflect the April 18,1997 merger with West Coast Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 includes an $8.0 million pre-tax gain on the sale of the company's subsidiary Bucktail Bank and Trust Co.</p>
<p>The gain was partially offset by recognition of $2.1 million in merger costs and an additional provision for loan losses of $1.7 million.</p>
<p>The co also said it recognized $2.6 million in severance payments and certain other charges.</p>
<p>Co had assets of $2.4 billion at June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
